# What the Docker build never needs, and must never contain.
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
src/api/IdeaDiscovery.Api/emails/
**/emails/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
.env*
!.env.example
src/api/**/.env*
# src/web/.env.api (VITE_DATA_SOURCE=api, no secrets) is needed by the client build.
.git
.github
.claude
.vs
docs/reference
deploy/*
!deploy/Caddyfile
